  "facts_of_case": "Appellant is the second wife of respondent, who had put up an advertisement for marriage stating he was a divorcee and well-to-do. Appellant married respondent in 1988, but within days, respondent threw her out and filed for divorce. Appellant also filed petition for separate residence and maintenance.",
